    "bedroom"
  ],
  "description": "Lightly based on Heli's makeup corner in the old house (video sources/old house/20261028_235945.mp4, ~18-19 s): an L-shaped white corner desk. Main wing (45 deep, 96 long) along the side wall: you sit straight at it facing the wall, knee space between its 2 thin legs and the drawer tower, the white tri-fold mirror right in front of you, her little lamp at the far end. Return wing (38 deep) along the back wall with a 5-drawer tower under it facing the room and her round mirror on it. A strong LED vanity light bar over the mirror (Mark: so she doesn't need the room light), its cord in a white cover to an outlet just above the desk. Put the item in a corner with offset 0: the main wing runs along its -x side. 88 wide x 96 deep x 75 high - estimated, not measured.",
  "source": {
    "kind": "parts",
    "notes": "Look from the old-house video frames at ~18-19 s; sizes estimated from the floor tiles, not measured. Light bar = a typical 60 cm LED vanity/mirror light (~10 W, ~900 lm).",
    "license": "self-made"
  },
